  "description": "Removal of the existing front and rear dormer windows and the erection of new dormer extensions to the front and rear roof slopes.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed alterations to the roof, by reason of their position, size, design and appearance of the front and rear roof dormer extensions would be intrusive alterations, out of scale and character with this and neighbouring dwellings, as well as having an adverse effect on the visual amenities of the locality. Thus, it is contrary to policy D4 (Delivering Good Design) of London Plan, Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) and the Residential Extension Guidelines SPD (May 2024) and the intent of NPPF. "
